  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4c3123130db224d45a77cee047322601, type: 3}
  m_Name: Train Interaction - OP1 - But what actually happened
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: "We\u2019re assessing the situation.\r\nThere appears to be an issue
      with the engine."
    textPL: "Sprawdzamy sytuacj\u0119.\r\nWygl\u0105da na to, \u017Ce wyst\u0105pi\u0142
      problem z silnikiem."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: 'A rather unexpected issue.

      Until further notice, the train cannot
      continue down the line.'
    textPL: "Do\u015B\u0107 niespodziewany problem.\r\nDo odwo\u0142ania poci\u0105g
      nie mo\u017Ce kontynuowa\u0107 jazdy."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: "So there\u2019s no way to fix it?"
    textPL: "Czyli nie da si\u0119 tego naprawi\u0107?"
    expressionName: sad
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: Not at the moment. The maintenance crew has been notified, but it will
      take some time for them to get here.
    textPL: "W tej chwili nie. Za\u0142oga techniczna zosta\u0142a powiadomiona,
      ale zajmie im troch\u0119 czasu, \u017Ceby tu dotrze\u0107."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: "For your own safety, please leave the train and remain near the station
      facilities.\r\nThe area beyond the tracks is\u2026 not recommended."
    textPL: "Dla w\u0142asnego bezpiecze\u0144stwa prosz\u0119 opu\u015Bci\u0107
      poci\u0105g i pozosta\u0107 w pobli\u017Cu budynk\xF3w stacji.\r\nTeren z dala
      od tor\xF3w jest\u2026 niewskazany."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: "Right. I guess I\u2019ll go check the station then."
    textPL: "Dobra. To chyba p\xF3jd\u0119 sprawdzi\u0107 stacj\u0119."
    expressionName: talking
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: Have a safe day, traveler.
    textPL: "\u017Bycz\u0119 spokojnego dnia, podr\xF3\u017Cniku."
    expressionName: 
  options: []
  offerQuestOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
  requiredCompletedQuests: []
